23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=34a1e44416ca9fcf334581436a44a67d 3x"}, "body": "Good evening! My name is Inami, and I am a Vsinger.\n\nThank you very much for your wonderful illustrations in the past...! I was secretly thinking that I would like to request your illustration again.... I have been secretly thinking that I would like to request your illustration again... so I have sent a request this time!\n\nI would like to request you to draw a character for my live-action video.\n\nMikoto Inaba (boy with black bob)\nHe is a boy with black bobbed hair. Gender is male.\nHeight is about 153cm.\n\nBrief description\nI am a junior in a regular high school.\nI post occult-related videos (such as tours of haunted places) on video-sharing websites.\nI also do research on the ghosts that are prevalent in the modern world.\n\nI apologize for the inconvenience, but please visit this URL for more information!\nYou are welcome to draw any costume you like.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1v1eXVI67i73FaJsaTbHnMZPaMXUgRyIe\n\nhttps://lit.link/inamicord\n\nExpression, composition, etc. will be left to us.\n\nI would be very happy if you could create a somewhat eerie atmosphere reminiscent of occult boards, fashionable fears, or modern-day hauntings.\nI would be very happy if you could give it a somewhat eerie atmosphere.\n\n~ Intended use\n\nUse on social networking sites\nUse in youtube videos\n\nWe would like to use the image as a thumbnail for ghost videos, live-action videos, Twitter icons, etc., with full credit.\nWe would like to use the image as a thumbnail for a ghost video, live-action video, Twitter icon, etc. If you could provide us with a transparent background, it would be greatly appreciated.\n\nI have always wanted to see your work in your style...! Thank you very much for your consideration.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@morning_nem